 ions\, built new partnerships\, cultivated support across the Global South
  and tried to deepen divisions within Western democracies. Her account com
 bines policy analysis with field reporting from more than a dozen countrie
 \n\nAges: All ages\nSource: https://cddrl.fsi.stanford.edu/events/book-tal
